        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "Per-workload and per-container VPA recommendations and safety boundaries:\n\n\u2022 **Target**: The optimal resource request recommended by VPA. In auto/in-place mode, VPA resizes requests to this value.\n\u2022 **Min (Lower Bound)**: Safety floor. Below this threshold, the container is at serious risk of CPU throttling or Out-Of-Memory (OOM) termination.\n\u2022 **Max (Upper Bound)**: Maximum resource ceiling based on historical peak spikes and safety headroom. Setting requests higher wastes capacity.\n\u2022 **Units**: CPU is in cores (e.g. 0.025 = 25m). Memory is in binary bytes (MiB / GiB).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            },
            "inspect": false
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Target CPU"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "short"
